In the CAR three people were killed in the collapse of the UN helicopter
Three people were killed and another was injured as a result of the crash of a Senegal Armed Forces who carried out an operation under the direction of the UN peacekeeping mission in the city of Bouair in the west of the CAR.
About it on Friday reports the portal DakarActu with reference to the Senegalese army.
The head of the mission, Mankeour Ndiaye, confirmed information about the plane crash, noting that the helicopter crash occurred at the time of landing.
According to DakarActu, the Mi-35 helicopter was returning after an operation to combat armed groups.
The Senegalese army reported that it is in contact with the United Nations on the issue of evacuating the victim and the bodies of the deceased.
Navalny's coordinator of Arkhangelsk Headquarters Sentenced to Communal Work
In the Oktyabrsky district court of Arkhangelsk announced the verdict of the coordinator of the regional headquarters Alexei Navalny Andrey Borovnikov.
For the repeated violation of the rules for holding rallies (Article 212.1 of the criminal Code of the Russian Federation, the so-called Dedinsky article), the court appointed him 400 hours of mandatory work, the correspondent of Kommersant reports from the courtroom.
The case was initiated in April of this year for organizing a rally against the construction of a garbage landfill in the Arkhangelsk region.
First under article 212.1 of the criminal code of the criminal code of the RUSSIAN thieves in 2015, activist Iildar Dadin was sentenced to three years in prison.
On the eve of the veripulation of the veripulate, on September 26, in the court held a debate between the parties.
Chargé d'utencies insisted on coercive labor for a period of three years.
In relation to me was chosen a preventive measure in the form of restriction of freedom, which consists in the fact that it is impossible for me to publicly attend mass events and it is impossible to communicate with the organizers of the protest on April 7.
“It’s been an electronic bracelet and base all this time.
That’s how my whereabouts were monitored.
I would not say that I was not confined to moving.
Recently flew from Moscow, where he was trained, ”said Andrey Borovikov.
After renovating the verifius, Navalny's regional headquarters said that the sentence would be served in Arkhangelsk.
On September 26, the Deputy from the CPRF faction Sergey Shargunov submitted to the state Duma a bill mitigating article 212.1 of the Criminal Code of the Russian Federation.
CPRF, LDPR and SR told Kommersant about their intention to support the initiative.
