The NSDC Secretary rejoiced
The Secretary of the national security and defense Council (NSDC) Oleksandr Danylyuk wrote a statement of resignation, according to the office of the President of the country.
This was done in front of Vladimir Zelensky's working visit to the United States for participation in the 74-th session of the General Assembly of the United Nations.
