The Russian pilot “Toro Rosso” Daniil Kvyat had to prematurely complete his first free practice Grand Prix of Formula 1.
The car of the Russian lost power and the rider could not reach boxes.
Kvyat parked the car in one of the security areas.
Before you fly out of the race, Toro Rossot took the fifth position.
It is expected that the second free practice will take place today, September 27, at 15:00 Moscow time on the "Sochi Autodrom".
Earlier it was reported that Kvyat shared his expectations from the Grand Prix of Sochi.
China strongly Opposes U.S. Accusations of ‘Tybei bill’
China stands strongly opposed to U.S. adoption of the so-called “Tybeya bill”, which severely violates the one-China principle and the principles of three Sino-American joint communiqués.
This was stated on Friday, the official representative of the Office of the State Council of the People’s Republic of China for Affairs of Tayyna Ma Xiaoguang.
Approval by the U.S. Senate Committee on Foreign Relations of this bill is also a serious violation of international law and the basic principles of international relations and gross meddling in the internal affairs of China, said Ma Xiaoguang.
According to him, Taiwan is a part of China, and related issues relate to the internal affairs of China.
“We call on the American side to clarify the situation, to immediately stop promoting relevant negative bills, and to immediately stop interfering in the Taiwan issue in order to avoid further compromising Sino-American relations as well as peace and stability in the Strait of Taiwan,” he said.
“China must and be reunited.
This historical trend can not be stopped by anyone and by any forces, Ma Xiaoguang stressed.
TikTok hide unwanted videos
According to TikTok, the number of its users in the world exceeds 500 million, of which is under the age of 18
Imagine China / Reuters
Chinese social network TikTok censors videos that mention Tiananmen Square, the independence of Tibet or a banned religious group Falun Gong, tells The Guardian.
In the documents of the publication, it is said that the owner of TikTok (VoteDance) with the help of the application is promoting China's foreign policy goals abroad.
The main part of violations relating to China's policy falls under "increasing hatred".
In each case, TikTok put unwanted publications in a context suitable for general rules so that the actions of the social network do not look censored.
For example, the ban on criticizing China's socialist system falls under a general ban "critically or attacks on the policies and social rules of any country, such as a constitutional monarchy, a parliamentary system, etc."
The prohibition of mention of incidents in Tiananmen Square or genocide in Cambodia falls under “discriminates against the history of China or other countries”.
The document also cites a list of banned names of twenty “foreign leaders or statesmen”, including North Korean leaders Kim Jong-il, Kim Il S-Sen and Kim Jong-un, an Indian politician Mahatma Gandhi, U.S. President Donald trump and Barack Obama, Japanese Prime Minister Shinzo Abe, South Korean President Pack Maun Gee, Indonesian President Joko Widódo and the Indian prime minister.
Prohibited material is diverged into two categories, the document says.
Publications from the first category are deleted by social network administrators and can result in a user blocking.
Not too severe violations belong to the second category: such publications remain on the site, but their distribution is limited to TikTok algorithms.
ByteDance representatives told The Guardian that these rules have become obsolete and are no longer applied: "Currturing we are using a localized approach for moderation, as well as involving independent local specialists."
Russian TikTok users do not have specific restrictions on publications, says Rustem Bogdanov, the co-founder of Producing Center.
"Producer Center" - one Russian media companies, which officially cooperates with TikTok.
All promotional materials of blogger "Producing Center" coordinates with the representatives of the social network, but the user materials can be placed without approval, Bogdanov reports.
To the question of whether TikTok it is possible to talk about politics or Putin, Bogdanov responds in an affirmative and says that he saw such publications.
Roman Zaripov agrees Bogdanov with Bogdanov: “TikTok lists the main rules for TikTok users: you can’t put shocking content, discriminating statements and so on.”
But under these rules you can bring any content that moderators do not like, Zaripov notes.
Zarispova Agency is another Russian partner of TikTok.
According to TikTok, the number of its users in the world exceeds 500 million, 40% of which are under the age of 18.
According to the user agreement, TikTok can use only persons older than the age of 13.
The administrators of the social network check their age with the help of artificial intelligence: the neural network analyzes the faces and determines how years a person looks, Bogdanov says.
If the neural network decides that the user is judging, his account can be deleted, he adds.
According to RBC, in September of 2019, ByteDance opened an office in Moscow on WeWork coworking grounds.
The inhabitants of Istanbul spoke about the earthquake in the city
A strong Earthquake caused a panic in the largest city of Turkey
Last Thursday, September 26, in Istanbul there was an earthquake of magnitude 5.9 in Istanbul.
Injured 34 people, ten of them are still in hospitals.
A resident of Istanbul Melike admitted that she for the first time in her life there was a panic attack.
“I cried so much cried.
Crucified right in the workplace.
Later it became easier, I returned to business.
But I’m so embarrassed right now!” – said the girl TV channel “360”.
In Istanbul there was a really strong Earthquoise
I don't want to come back yet!
But in general, I’m in order,” political scientist Ceylan Ozgül shared his impressions.
Selin's project manager noted that the mayor of the city keeps all the residents informed, but, according to her, the citizens still feel small tremors with a magnitude of approximately 3.2 or 3.5.
She also drew attention to the communication problem immediately after an earthquake.
Zhevnushka said that she could not reach the mother, but the Internet worked “excellent” and she was able to send a message via WhatsApp.
As the website kp.ru wrote, all kindergartens and schools were closed after the overclocking, where all students were evacuitors were evacuated.
473 buildings were injunction.
The epicenter of powerful tremors was recorded 68 kilometers to the west of Istanbul, in the Marble Sea.
Matthews met with the management of "Toronto".
Toronto striker Oston Matthews held a meeting with the leadership of the club.
