In Roszdravnadzor reported on the results of the inspection on the fact of amputation of the child
The child in the Rostov region amputated the hand because of the mistake of doctors, reports “Vzglyad” with reference to the website of the territorial body of Roszdravnadzor.
11-year-old boy broke his arm, after which a plaster was applied to him in the Zernogradsky district.
After a certain time, the child developed gangrene, an amputation was carried out.
As a result of the test, it turned out that violations of the timeliness and correctness of the diagnosis, as well as the standard and the amount of assistance provided were committed.
The materials of the inspection are transferred to the SU IC of Russia in the region.
Earlier URA.RU reported that the chief doctor of the Yuzhnouralsk city hospital was arrested.
The Russians warned about fake calls from the banks
In Russia there is an increase the number of calls from scammers, who are reassured by the phone number of the bank.
About it reports “Kommersant” with reference to the data of the Central Bank.
In the summer of 2019, the regulator gave the telecom operators information about more than 2.5 thousand numbers from which customers of various financial organizations were called.
In 189 cases, the operators found a substituation of the number.
Another 218 rooms were blocked, and in 59 cases established a restriction on the use of financial services.
The Deputy head of the Department of information security of the Central Bank Artem Sycheva said that a wide range of Russian banks collided with the substitution of the number.
He explained that the operators do not always retaliate to the Central Bank's warnings about fragrant calls, referring to the absence of such an obligation in the law “On communication”.
Otkritie Bank, Rosbank and Alfa-Bank confirmed the information about an increase in the number of fraudulent bells replacing the number.
As reported in the press service of “Beeline”, part of the information about fraudulent bells, which was conveyed by the Central Bank, it was incorrect: numbers that are really used by banks to communicate with customers were included.
Blocking them would lead to malculivities.
Artem Sychev said that the Central Bank plans to create a database of scimuli numbers, to which the telecom operator will be contacted at each call to verify the number.
He explained that to create such a base, it would be necessary to make legislative amendments.
The U.N.-China trade talks will be resemblance on October 10
A new round of trade negotiations between the United States and China will be held in Washington on October 10, CNBC reported.
According to its sources, the Chinese delegation will be headed by Vice-President of the State Council of the People's Republic Of China Liu He.
It should be noted that the last round of trade negotiations between the United States and China was held in Shanghai at the end of July, but the parties were never able to make progress.
New mutual duties of the United States and China came into force on September 1.
Earlier, the President of the United States Donald trump said that Washington and Beijing can reach a trade agreement earlier than it was assumed.
The state Duma will check for violations of the law “Voice of America”, “Meduza” and “B-BI”
The state Duma Commission on the investigation of foreign interference in the internal affairs of Russia, will conduct inspections of some media on violations of Russian legislation.
About it reports "Interfax" with reference to the head of the commission Vasily Piskarev.
In the field of view of the Commission were “Medusa”, “MBH Media”, “Voice of America”, “Current Time”, “Radio Liberty” and the “Russian BBC service”.
Earlier it was reported about the planned audits of the services of Google and Facebook.
Piskarev also said that he will ask the foreign Ministry to take a decision on the further acviquitment of the German Deutsche Welle, whose publications the Commission found signs of justification of extremism.
In September, Roskomnadzor revealed political advertising in the services of Google, Facebook and youtube.
According to the agency, this happened during the Russian elections on September 8.
Facts of violations were transferred to the state Duma Commission.
Subsequently, Google said that the company maintains responsible political advertising.
According to employees, it is obliged to comply with the country's laws.
The company Facebook noted that the responsibility for complying with the electoral legislation of Russia should be carried out by advertisers, and not a platform.
The head of Roskomnadzor Alexander Zharov accused the company of using double standards in the placement of political advertising.
Stoltenberg Discludes With Zelensky the accession of Ukraine to NATO
NATO Secretary General Jens Stoltenberg and Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky also discussed Ukraine’s membership in an alliance on the sidelines of the 74-th session of the UN General Assembly.
The Secretary-general said about this during a speech at the University of Colombia in New York.
Responding to the question whether the relevant topic was raised during the meeting, Stoltenberg said that they really discussed this issue, and also stressed that in his answer he did not name the timing of Ukraine's accession to NATO.
According to him, any country that would like to join the North-Atlantic Alliance is obliged to fulfill certain conditions in order to comply with specific standards.
In the Crimea offered Zelensky an alternative to the course in NATO
The President of Ukraine Volodymyr Zelensky instead of the course on joining NATO should be engaged in establishing good-neighbition relations with Russia.
About it on Friday, September 27, said the co-chairman of the Assembly of Slavic peoples of the Republic of Crimea Roman Chegrin.
“Pan president of Ukraine does not need to replicate the mistakes of its predecessor, but it is necessary to listen to the advice of [US President] Donald trump, whom he listened with an sour face, and to establish relations with the President of Russia,” Chegrinets told RIA Novosti.
Chegrinets noted that Zelensky is a good actor for him, but a bad politician.
According to him, it will be possible to remain in the power of the Ukrainian President only in the case of establishing relations with the Russian Federation.
Earlier on September 27, NATO Secretary General Jens Stoltenberg said that he held a conversation with Zelensky on the country's accession to the alliance.
According to him, for this, Ukraine is obliged to fulfill certain conditions.
On June 5, MP Yevgeny Balitsky said that the possible accession of Ukraine to the alliance does not guarantee an improvement in life in the country.
“Money is more important than football.
“Barcelona” is blackmailing Neymar
Spanish “Barcelona” and its former football player Brazilian Neymar are trying to settle the financial dispute, which arose after the transfer of the striker to the French “Paris Saint-Germain”.
The case almost came to court, but the Catalans offered the player to resolve the dispute without the intervention of Femida.
In other words, they refuse to come back to him.
Neymar and his circling father, who is also an agent of the Brazilian, started an interesting focus: in an agreement with Barsa, which the player signed in 2017, he was supposed to receive 40 million euros.
However, just a year later, the striker was in “PSG” for a record 222 million euros.
Nevertheless, he received from the Catalans of 22 million and now wants to take the remaining 18.
Moreover, the lawyers of the Brazilian insist that the club also owes him the interest for late payment.
When in the capital of Catalonia it became known about Neymar’s claims, “Barcelona” sent a counterclaim.
“Blue pomegranates” insist that the bonus relied for the fulfillment of the entire contract - from 2016 to 2022.
Correspondingly, the club believes that the player relied only a quarter of 40 million euros and demanded a refund of the proportional part of the first payment.
But the most interesting thing is that in the summer Neymar and “Bars” almost agreed on the return of an “prodigal” player in the wagon of Catalonia.
However, the deal broke down, but the hope for the return of the forward remains.
And so, according to Sports.Ru with reference to insiders, the lawyers of the club told representatives of the player that if the question of financial claims is not resolved pre-trial, this will exclude the possibility of the return of the Brazilian.
Neymar himself so wants to return that he asked for guarantees that the Catalans will redeem it.
March Laor: EKRE members won’t be included in the Board of the Bank of Estonia
EKRE members have not and won’t be invited.
On the composition of the Board of the Bank of Excursions are drawn conclusions about the confidence of the Estonian state.
