In the foreign Ministry of the Russian Federation commented on the scandal in Kirgizia from the Malakhov show
The Russian foreign Ministry commented on the situation with the indignation, which in Kyrgyzstan caused the next issue of Andrei Malakhov program “Live”, RIA Novosti reports.
Earlier, the Russian diplomat was summoned to the Ministry of foreign Affairs of Kyrgyzstan after the broadcast of the program.
In the Ministry of foreign Affairs of the Republic believe that the presenter admitted incorrect statements regarding the situation around the citizen of Kyrgyzstan Islambek Akbarov, who became a participant in an accident in which the Russian Alexander Marugov died.
Malakhov said that the citizen of Kyrgyzstan could have set up an accident.
Accident occurred on July 8 in Moscow.
Marugov crashed on a motorbike in a cab, which was driven by Akbarov.
According to preliminary data, the custodian is the culprit of an accident.
Malahov himself, who demanded an apology by the citizens of Kyrzya, said that these words were simply a personal opinion.
As explained in the Russian foreign Ministry, the Ministry of foreign Affairs of Kyrgyzstan did not cause Russian diplomats - there was a planned working visit, during which, among other issues, the statements of the TV presenter were discussed.
“Andrey Malakhov’s point of view is the opinion of the journalist, his personal opinion on the situation”, – said the foreign Ministry, answering that this incident will not affect the interstate relations of the Russian Federation and Kyrgyzstan.
Figure skaters Artemyeva and Nazarychev won the stage of the junior Grand Prix in Zagreb
Russian figure skaters Yulia Artemyeva and Mikhail Nazarychev won the gold in the competition of sports pairs at the stage of the junior Grand Prix, held in Zagreb, writes TASS.
For the short and arbitrary programs Artemyev and Nazarychev received 179.83 points.
In the second place with the result of 177.58 points was another Russian pair - Diana Mukhametzyanova and Ilya Mironov, bronze went to the Germans Annika Hock and Robert Kunkel (156.31 points).
Russian couple Anna Shcheglova and Ilya Kalashnikov took the fourth place (19.67 points).
The winners of the stage in Zagreb reached the final of the junior Grand Prix.
It will be held in Turin from December 5 to December 8.
After September 27, an arbitrary program will be shown by young men in solitary skating.
The tournament in the Croatian capital will end on Saturday, September 28.
On September 21, Russian figure skater Alexander Trusova has set new world world records in an arbitrary program and the amount of points at the tournament in Slovakia.
Dependants evaluated its arbitrary rental at 163.78 points, and a short program - at 74.91 points.
For a 15-year-on-year-old athlete, these competitions were the first at an adult level.
Alexander Lukashenko intends to use the cosmetics only production of Belarus
Belarusian President Alexander Lukashenko intends to use cosmetics of only production of Belarus.
Lukashenko today in Minsk visited one of the local enterprises for the production of cosmetics.
He stated that imported cosmetics is not better than Belarusian, and the advantage of domestic products is that it is made from local raw materials.
“We need to use our own,” the Belarusian leader said.
Alexander Lukashenko said about the need to promote sales of Belarusian cosmetics abroad.
In August, the leader of Belarus advised local processors of sugar to find new markets for the sale of products.
Lukashenko urged the company not to focus on exports to Russia and “not to suffer”.
The situation with sugar exports has deteriorated due to an excess of the product in the sales markets.
This also applied to Russia, in which due to the surplus of sugar began to cost 50 kopecks a kilogram less than in Belarus.
In Domodedovo the truck killed a seven-year-old girl
The driver shot down a mother with a child at a pedestrian crossing to Domodedovo, told “Interfax” the head of the press service of the GU of the Ministry of Internal Affairs of Russia in the Moscow region Tatyana Petrova.
As told Petrova, the incident occurred on Friday at 08:25 on Gagarin street.
The mother with her daughter hit a resident of Domodedovo born in 1994 at the wheel of the truck "Gas".
As a result of the accident, the seven-year-old child died on the spot, and the woman was hospitalized.
“A criminal case was opened against the driver under Part 3 of Article 264 of the criminal code (violation of the rules of the road and the operation of vehicles, which negligedly the death of a person)”, – said the representative of the regional head of the police.
The sanction of this article stipulates a maximum penalty of deprivation of liberty for a period of up to 5 years.
At the moment, the offender is detained, Petrova concluded.
The former head of the DPR spoke about his work in Russia
The former acting head of the self-proceded Donetsk people’s Republic (DPR), Dmitry Trapeznikov, who headed the administration of Elista, assessed the state of the city.
The official said about this in the comments of the Telegram-channel “Slifting”.
According to him, the city is in a depreciable economic condition.
“It is Necessary to equalize the economy, it is necessary to attach an economical hand: here, of course, you also need to do the roads and external lighting”, – he said, adding that among the tasks is to make a comfortable landscaped city.
Trapeznikov as mayor Elista was proposed by the head of Kalmykia Batu Khasikov.
The former acting head of the DPR admitted that he was familiar with the head of the region for a long time.
In particular, he repeatedly came to the republic, where he was engaged in working with young people and held sports events.
“And here he appealed to me, invited to visit Kalmykia and to give an expert assessment of the condition of the city, and then offered to head the city,” the official added.
Separately, Trapeznikov commented the information of a source owned by Grigory Berezkin RBC, who reported that his candidacy to the head of Kalmyk was proposed by presidential aide Vladislav Surkov, who, according to the publication, “has long been friends” with Khasikov.
“There’s not much to write.
And at the level of various fictitious stories happens.
I don’t think we shouldn’t pay attention,” he said.
The mayor of Elisha also added that he has both Russian citizenship and DPR passport.
On September 26, he headed the administration of Elista.
Putin and the S.Izbaz Ministry Discuss the Provision of Security without INF
At the meeting also discussed the settlement in Syria after the formation of a constitutional committee
The President of Russia Vladimir Vladimir Putin discussed security issues with the Security Council after the termination of the Treaty on Intermediate-Range and Shorter-Range Missile Missile, taking into account the proposal to a number of NATO member countries to impose a moratorium on the deployment of RIDS.
This was reported by the press Secretary of the Russian leader Dmitry Peskov.
The representative of the Kremlin noted that the meeting also discussed current issues of socio-economic development of the country, as well as future prospects for a settlement in Syria after the formation of a constitutional committee.
The meeting was attended by Prime Minister Dmitry Medvedev, the Chairman of the Federation Council Valentina Matviyenko, Secretary of the Security Council Nikolay Patrushev, FSB Alexander Bortnnikov, the head of the defense Ministry Sergei Shoigu, the Director of the Foreign Intelligence Service Sergey Naryshkin.
On September 25, the Russian leader sent to some member countries of the North Atlantic Alliance a proposal to introduce a moratorium on the placement of intermediate-range and short-range missiles in Europe.
Alnyn’s Constituent Secretary Jens Stoltenberg called Putin’s proposal unreifciable.
Domplus demolished the overpass on the route under construction in the Crimea
The dump truck with a raised body shot down two beams of the overpass under construction on the Tavrida highway in the Crimea.
The driver managed to jump out of the cavity and thereby saved his life.
the incident occurred on the morning of September 27 in the Bakhchisarai district of the peninsula.
The man at the wheel of a heavy car forgot to lower the body, and when he remembered - it was already too late to brake.
The driver jumped out of the cab, and the drump truck crashed into the overpidation at speed.
Collapsed beam crumplants crumpled crumpled the cabin and blocked the roadway along which, however, there is no movement yet.
The amount of the damage has yet yet to be determined, it is planned to be recovered from the subcontractor for the construction of the highway, whose driver caused an accident.
Medvedev congratulated educators on a professional holiday
Prime Minister of Russia Dmitry Medvedev congratulated educators and all pre-school workers on a professional holiday.
According to him, the future of their children depends on them.
This is stated in the telegram, published on the website of the Government.
Medvedev noted that the educator's profession is a special profession that requires a huge love for his work, wisdom, patience and modern knowledge.
Your parents are trusting your child.
And you are doing everything so that the Kindergarnament will become for children a second-hosted home, which is coercive, interesting, safe.
“Together with you, they will get to know the surrounding world, the beauty of nature, music, poetry, they learn independence, the ability to communicate and be friends,” the President of the Government said.
