NPF - these are private companies, reports "Volgogradskaya Pravda.ru".
They work as a deposit: you make contributions, the fund invests them and eventually returns you money with interest.
If you are interested in this method, you first take a study of NPF information on the website of the Bank of Russia.
All funds operate according to uniform rules, which are established by federal laws.
Retirement points can be bought under the law.
The number of missing points depends on how many years of experience you are not enough to calculate the pension.
This method is suitable for those who have worked informally.
