Representatives of the media visited the fourth power unit of the Chernobyl nuclear power plant
The video, made in the control room of the fourth power unit at the Chernobyl nuclear power plant, appeared on the Internet, it was the first to be published on a YouTube video agency Ruptly.
It is noted that a group of 15 representatives of the mass media received access to the fourth ChNPP management hall as part of the presentation of a guidebook on the exclusion zone.
As reported in the RT Telegram-channel, the journalists stayed there in special protective suits for less than five minutes, since the ruins of the power unit destroyed by the Explosion still exude radiation, 40 thousand times the norm.
The accident at the Chernobyl nuclear power plant occurred on the night of April 26, 1986.
Radiation pollution were subjected to 12 regions in Ukraine and 23% of the area of Belarus.
In Russia, 19 regions were affected.
We will remind, in July of this year, the Ukrainian leader Volodymyr Zelensky signed a decree, according to which in the Chernobyl zone there was a green corridor opened for tourists.
Also in the zone of alienation lifted the ban on filming.
