The court issued a verdict to the author of a commemorative petition on the accession of Latvia to the United States
The court of the Vidzeme suburb of Riga issued a punishment to the author of a communicative petition for the accession of Latvia to the United States of the United States of America Denis Bartesky.
It is noted that the man was prescribed 80 hours of corrective labor and one year of probation.
“Could sense is not the most powerful side of our system”, – commented the Bartets court’s decision.
He also added that the punishment is usually less than requested.
The collection of signatures on the accession of Latvia to the United States was organized in 2016.
