Hydrometeorological center called the faithful popular signs
In Russia, there are a lot of popular signs, according to which people are trying to predict the weather.
“Unfortunately, not all of them are working.
In the hydrometeorological center checked all the signs that supposedly work.
Meteorologists came to the conclusion that only two of them can really be trusted, however, in the short-term time period.
Roman Vilfand told the scientific director of the Hydrometeorological Center of Russia, if the sun is red during the call, then the next day will really be war-floating, as our ancestors noticed.
And if there is a whitish luminary in ancestral, then the next day it will come to rain.
The second working cipbrushance is based on the observation of the birds.
More often they talk about swallows, if they fly low, then this is usually for the rain.
It is explained simply - when the humidity of the air is high, then the mosquirrels wet wings and feathers are forced to decrease to hunt insects, writes TASS.
On different continents there are popular signs.
Groundhog Day is a traditional national holiday in the United States and Canada, celebrated annually on February 2.
It is believed that on this day you need to observe the marsfight coming out of your burrow to determine the time of the arrival of the spring.
Unidentified oil skulls found on the beaches of the north-east of Brazil
Oil skulls of unknown origin were discovered on 99 beaches in the northeast of Brazil.
Fodges of pollution were scattered for two thousand kilometers of the coastline.
Messages about the first discovered oil stains began to arrive on the second of September.
However, every day until Thursday, their number, as well as the territorial coverage, continued to increase.
The Brasi Environmental Institute carried out a chic analysis of the identified samples.
It turned out that all of them are identical and we are talking about crude oil.
In the state oil corporation Petrobras, which were handed over for analysis of the found speculators, they said that in their composition they do not correspond to the oil extracted from the fields on the territory of Brazil.
“It’s thick oil.
It can be dropped from one of the ships after cleaning the tanks.
A lot of people continue to do that.
And most likely, it got into an oceanic trend, ”said Rojerio Almeida, the coordinator of the trade union of oil workers of Pernambucu and Parahib Rojererio Almeida, told the Brazilian news portal G1.
He also added that, despite the ban of this practice, many ships continue to dump waste on the high sea.
On the beaches of four of the eight affected states of the north-east, environmentalists discovered nine sea turtools, completely covered with oil film.
And only two of them managed to be rescued.
In the coming days, the Brazil Environmental Institute, together with Petrobras, will start clearing polluted beaches.
And in the meantime, experts of the Institute recommend that tourists and local residents bypass oil spots and notify about all detected foci of pollution.
Medvedev instructed to revise the norms of work of catering enterprises
Prime Minister Dmitry Medvedev instructed Rospotrebnadzor, the Ministry of justice, the Ministry of Economy and the Ministry of Industry and Trade, together with the business ombudsman and the business community to revise sanitary and epidemiological rules and norms for catering organizations.
They will also need to study the issue of the transition to the implementation of the requirements established by technical regulations of the Eurasian Economic Union.
Their proposals of the departments must submit their proposals to the government no later than October 15, it is said in the list of instructions of Mr. Medved on the results of the program “Dialogue “Dialogue “Dialogue “Rossiys 24”.
By the same date, Mr. Medvedev instructed all the mentioned departments, in addition to the Ministry of Justice, to provide proposals to conduct an experiment from January 1, 2020 to limit control measures for catering organizations in a number of regions, including Moscow, Tatarstan and Kaliningrad region.
By November 11 the Ministry of justice and the Ministry of Economy were instructed to submit to the government a draft law with amendments to the Administrative Code on the application of administrative suspension of activities for violating the requirements to the organization of meals, because of which damage to health was caused.
In addition, the Ministry of labor, the Ministry of economy, Rospotrebnadzor and the Ministry of Finance need to work out the gradual transition from 2021 to the formation of a consumer basket based on a basic set of products that allows you to create a full-fledged diet of healthy food.
We will remind, the outdated norms of the requirements of the business community began to talk after one café was locked from the network “Anderson”.
The business community has demanded to cancel the existing SanPiNS, Rospotrebnadzor announced the joint development of new ones.
33 agencies were included in the list.
Meanwhile, Rospotrebnadzor intends to reduce the number of sanitary norms and rules by 40 times by 2021.
